00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Grand Piano is a thriller, mystery film directed by Eugenio Mira.

3
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Tom Selznick, the most talented pianist of his generation, stopped
performing in public because of his stage fright.

4
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Years after a catastrophic performance, he reappears in
public in a long awaited concert in Chicago.

5
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Just moments after starting his performance in the packed theater, in front of an expectant audience,
Tom finds a threatening message written on the score: 'Play one wrong note and you die'.

6
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Without leaving the piano, Tom must discover the anonymous sniper's
motives and look for help without anyone realizing.

